# cloud-drill.sh --inventory: one host per line,
#   address  ssh_user  ssh_port  validators
# address is what the controller and the other hosts reach the host at (it goes
# into every node URL); validators is how many this host runs. The 10 x 3 layout
# below is the recommended one (PROVIDER-SPEC.md): losing a whole host stops 3
# validators, within the tolerance of a committee of 10. Spread the hosts over 3
# regions, in this order, so consecutive lines are in different regions.
203.0.113.11  drill  22  3
198.51.100.21 drill  22  3
192.0.2.31    drill  22  3
203.0.113.12  drill  22  3
198.51.100.22 drill  22  3
192.0.2.32    drill  22  3
203.0.113.13  drill  22  3
198.51.100.23 drill  22  3
192.0.2.33    drill  22  3
203.0.113.14  drill  22  3
